Uh, I know this is a long shot, but how 'bout tomorrow night ?
/ˈʌ aɪ ˈnoʊ ðɪs ɪz ɐ ˈlɑːŋ ˈʃɑːt ˌbʌt ˌhaʊ ˈbaʊt təˈmɔːroʊ ˈnaɪt/

181
00:07:46,906 --> 00:07:49,317
Yeah. What the hell ?
/ˈjɛh ˌwʌt ðə ˈhɛl/

182
00:07:54,548 --> 00:07:55,557
Jerk !
/ˈdʒɜːk/

183
00:07:56,649 --> 00:07:57,764
That was fun.
/ðæt wʌz ˈfʌn/

184
00:07:59,017 --> 00:08:01,738
De... wait for it... nied !
/ˈdə ˈweɪt fɔːr ɪt ˈnaɪd/

185
00:08:01,738 --> 00:08:03,143
